Temporary workaround for downstream provider spans bypassing LiteLLM's
model-call span when forward_traceparent_to_llm_provider is enabled.

Inject the model-call span context at the provider handoff. Remove when the
pinned upstream release passes verify_tracing.py without this patch; retain the
regression check.

